# ADR-0326 error-code catalogue baseline — the kernel's own codes (PlatformErrorCode).
#
# One line per published code: CODE<TAB>CATEGORY. APPEND-ONLY. A code is a contract clients branch
# on, so a line here is never removed, renamed or moved to another category. Adding a code to the
# enum requires adding its line here in the same change; PlatformErrorCodeCatalogueTest fails in
# both directions.
VALIDATION_ERROR	VALIDATION
UNAUTHORIZED	UNAUTHENTICATED
FORBIDDEN	FORBIDDEN
NOT_FOUND	NOT_FOUND
CONFLICT	CONFLICT
IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED	CONFLICT
IDEMPOTENCY_REQUEST_IN_PROGRESS	CONFLICT
BUSINESS_RULE_VIOLATION	RULE_VIOLATION
RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED	RATE_LIMITED
POLICY_DECISION_POINT_UNAVAILABLE	UNAVAILABLE
SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE	UNAVAILABLE
INTERNAL_ERROR	INTERNAL
AMOUNT_SCALE_EXCEEDED	VALIDATION
CURRENCY_UNSUPPORTED	VALIDATION
AMOUNT_NOT_POSITIVE	VALIDATION
